WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:07.140
&gt;&gt; I'M JOINED
LIVE NOW BY THE MEMPHIS POLICE

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.209
CHIEF, CJ DAVIS THANK YOU FOR
JOINING US.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:12.378
I'M GOING TO WEAR MY GLASSES
BECAUSE I HAVE SPECIFIC THINGS I

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.849
WANT TO ASK YOU ABOUT.
THESE FIVE OFFICERS HAVE BEEN

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.151
CHARGED WITH SECOND DEGREE
MURDER IN THE DEATH OF TYRE

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.853
NICHOLS.
WHAT'S YOUR REACTION TO THESE

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:23.356
VERY SERIOUS CHARGES?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I EXPECTED SERIOUS

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.591
CHARGES.
I REALLY DID.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:29.028
ACTUALLY, THE CHARGES THAT WERE
PLACED -- AT LEAST THE

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:32.298
ADMINISTRATIVE CHARGES WERE
PROBABLY THE MOST SEVERE I'VE

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:35.034
SEEN IN MY CAREER BUT THEY WERE
ABSOLUTELY APPROPRIATE.

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:40.306
I KNEW THAT THE NEXT STEP WOULD
BE IN THE HANDS OF THE DA'S

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:44.244
OFFICE SO I'M NOT SURPRISED.
&gt;&gt; THESE ARE EXTRAORDINARY

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:47.680
MEASURES I MUST SAY IN ALL THE
TIMES I'VE COVERED THESE

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:54.487
INCIDENTS TO FIRE THE OFFICERS
AND CHARGE THEM SO QUICKLY.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:59.159
DOES THAT SPEAK TO WHAT WE'LL
SEE ON THE VIDEOTAPE WHEN IT'S

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.361
RELEASED AFTER 7:00 P.M. EA
EASTERN.

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:06.032
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.
OVER THE LAST SEVERAL YEARS WE

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.701
HAVE TALKED ABOUT POLICE
LEGITIMACY AND POLICE REFORM.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:12.105
IT'S IMPORTANT THAT, IN
INSTANCES LIKE THIS, WHEN THEY

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:19.846
ARE SERIOUS, WHEN THEY DO ARISE
TO THAT LEVEL, WHERE A PERSON'S

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:21.814
CONST
CONSTITUTIONAL RIGHTS, THEIR

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:25.018
CIVIL RIGHTS HAVE BEEN VIOLATED
THAT WE ACT AND ACT SWIFTLY.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:28.755
&gt;&gt; WHEN DID YOU FIRST LEARN
ABOUT THE INCIDENT, CHIEF?

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.992
&gt;&gt; IT WAS PROBABLY 4:00 IN THE
MORNING, THE PREVIOUS DAY, 8:00

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:36.896
AT NIGHT, 9:00, THE INCIDENT
OCCURRED.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.398
ABOUT 4:00 IN THE MORNING I
LEARNED OF THE INCIDENT.

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:44.504
AND IT WAS JUST A STRANGE
SUMMARY OF WHAT OCCURRED ON THE

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.406
TRAFFIC STOP.
I DECIDED TO GO IN THE OFFICE

00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:49.942
AND MEET WITH THE INDIVIDUALS
THAT HAD INFORMATION THAT I

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:55.815
COULD TAKE A LOOK AT IT, EVEN
THOUGH AT THAT TIME, TYRE WAS IN

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:59.485
THE HOSPITAL, BUT STILL BECAUSE
HE HAD INJURIES THAT JUST -- I

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:04.624
JUST DIDN'T UNDERSTAND.
IT WAS INCOMPREHENSIBLE TO ME.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.427
WE CAME IN THE OFFICE AND
DECIDED TO TAKE A LOOK THAT

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:09.829
SUNDAY MORNING AND IT WAS
ALARMING.

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:12.265
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHEN YOU -- SUNDAY
MORNING IS WHEN YOU FIRST SAW

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:13.533
THE VIDEO?
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:18.905
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU SAW IT, WHAT WAS
YOUR REACTION?

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:26.579
&gt;&gt; I WAS -- I WAS OUTRAGED.
I WAS -- IT WAS INCOMPREHENSIBLE

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:31.251
TO ME.
IT WAS UNCONSCIONABLE.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:35.955
I FELT THAT I NEEDED TO DO
SOMETHING AND DO SOMETHING

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:36.923
QUICKLY.
I DON'T THINK I WITNESSED

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.459
ANYTHING OF THAT NATURE MY
ENTIRE CAREER.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:42.262
&gt;&gt; REALLY?
&gt;&gt; REALLY.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:45.431
&gt;&gt; THAT BAD?
&gt;&gt; IT WAS THAT BAD.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:46.399
&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE WE GOING TO SEE
THEN?

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:54.774
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE GOING TO SEE ACTS THAT
DEFY HUMANITY.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:03:01.547
YOU'RE GOING TO SEE A DISREGARD
FOR LIFE.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:05.518
DUTY OF CARE THAT WE'RE ALL
SWORN TO.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:11.557
AND A LEVEL OF PHYSICAL
INTERACTION THAT IS ABOVE AND

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:18.731
BEYOND WHAT IS REQUIRED IN LAW
ENFORCEMENT.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:24.337
AND I'M SURE THAT, YOU KNOW, AS
I SAID BEFORE, THAT INDIVIDUALS

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:26.472
WATCHING WILL FEEL WHAT THE
FAMILY FELT.

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:30.443
AND IF YOU DON'T, THEN YOU'RE
NOT A HUMAN BEING.

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:35.748
AND WE ALL ARE HUMAN BEINGS.
AND I THINK THERE WILL BE A

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:39.786
MEASURE OF SADNESS AS WELL.
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG DO THESE INCIDENTS

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.521
GO ON?
WE HEARD FROM THE DISTRICT

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:45.391
ATTORNEY YESTERDAY AND FROM THE
HEAD OF THE TBI THAT THERE WERE

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.193
TWO SEPARATE INCIDENTS, RIGHT?
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:51.731
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG DO THEY GO ON AND
WHEN -- WHAT WAS THE WORST PART

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:54.033
OF IT?
BECAUSE IT HAS BEEN SAID THAT

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:57.370
THE OFFICERS BECAME CHARGED
DURING THE SECOND INCIDENT, THAT

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:02.175
THEY GOT MORE RILED UP.
&gt;&gt; WELL, FROM THE VERY BEGINNING

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:04.977
TO ME THEY WERE RILED UP.
I DON'T THINK THEY WERE AS AMPED

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:11.417
UP AS THEY WERE AT THE SECOND
SCENE BUT JUST THE STOP, THE

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:17.857
NATURE OF THE STOP, VERY
AGGRESSIVE, LOUD, YOU KNOW,

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:21.027
COMMUNICATION.
AND IT WAS -- IT JUST ROSE FROM

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:25.431
THERE.
IT ESCALATED FROM THERE.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:29.802
MR. NICHOLS WAS ABLE TO GET AWAY
FROM THESE OFFICERS AND THEY

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:35.942
FOUND HIM, AGAIN, AT ANOTHER
LOCATION AND AT THAT POINT,

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:41.514
THERE WAS AN AMOUNT OF
AGGRESSION THAT IS

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:45.251
UNEXPLAINABLE.
YOU KNOW, IN ANY INSTANCE WHERE

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:48.654
YOU'RE APPREHENDING SOMEONE --
EVEN IN THE WORST SITUATION

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:51.724
WHERE THERE IS RESISTANCE,
OFFICERS STILL HAVE THE

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:56.629
RESPONSIBILITY TO EXERCISE CARE
AND REGARD FOR ANY INDIVIDUAL

00:04:56.629 --> 00:05:00.700
THAT'S IN CUSTODY OR THEY'RE
ATTEMPTING TO APPREHEND, AND

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:05.238
THEY'RE TRAINED TO DO THAT.
&gt;&gt; AND TO DE-ESCALATE.

00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:07.373
&gt;&gt; AND TO DE-ESCALATE.
THAT'S THE PIECE, I THINK, THAT

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:10.943
IS IN QUESTION.
BUT I THINK THE ESCALATION WAS

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:15.715
THERE FROM THE OFFICERS BEFORE
TRAINING EVEN NEEDED TO COME IN

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:19.952
AS IT RELATES TO DE-ESCALATE.
THE ESCALATION WAS ALREADY AT A

00:05:19.952 --> 00:05:22.221
HIGH LEVEL.
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE SAYING THEY DID

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:24.657
EVERYTHING WRONG?
YOU THINK THIS WAS OUTSIDE OF

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:27.126
THEIR TRAINING, EVERYTHING.
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:29.429
&gt;&gt; YOU MENTIONED, YOU SAID THE
NATURE OF THE STOP.

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:32.131
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; CAN WE TALK ABOUT THE NATURE

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:33.266
OF THE STOP.
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.835
&gt;&gt; WHAT WAS THE NATURE?
WHY WAS HE STOPPED?

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:42.375
&gt;&gt; I'M GOING TO BE HONEST WITH
YOU ABOUT THE STOP ITSELF.

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:48.681
WHAT WAS SAID WAS THAT THERE WAS
WITNESSING OF WHAT WAS

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:52.885
CONSIDERED RECKLESS DRIVING.
WE'VE LOOKED AT CAMERAS, WE'VE

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:57.756
LOOKED AT BODY-WORN CAMERAS.
AND EVEN IF SOMETHING OCCURRED

00:05:57.756 --> 00:06:03.095
PRIOR TO THE STOP, WE'VE BEEN
UNABLE TO SUBSTANTIATE THAT AT

00:06:03.095 --> 00:06:07.133
THIS TIME.
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE HAVEN'T BEEN ABLE TO

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:09.135
SUBSTANTIATE --
&gt;&gt; THE RECKLESS DRIVING.

00:06:09.135 --> 00:06:10.603
&gt;&gt; AT ALL?
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:14.273
WE HAVE NOT BEEN ABLE TO
SUBSTANTIATE THE RECKLESS

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:15.908
DRIVING.
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS WHY HE WAS

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:19.378
SUPPOSEDLY STOPPED.
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS WHY HE WAS

00:06:19.378 --> 00:06:21.347
SUPPOSEDLY STOPPED IN THE VERY
BEGINNING.

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:23.716
THAT WAS A CONCERN.
SO IN AN INVESTIGATION WE BEGIN

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:26.986
TO LOOK AT WHAT WAS THE PROBABLE
CAUSE FOR THE STOP, WHERE WERE

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:33.226
THE CAMERAS?
WAS THERE SOME EVIDENCE ON THE

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:39.198
BODY CAMERA, ALONG THOSE CAMERAS
ON THOSE THOROUGHFARES?

00:06:39.198 --> 00:06:43.402
AND WE'VE TAKEN AN EXTENSIVE
LOOK TO DETERMINE WHAT THAT

00:06:43.402 --> 00:06:46.405
PROBABLE CAUSE WAS AND HE HAVE
NOT BEEN ABLE TO SUBSTANTIATE

00:06:46.405 --> 00:06:49.075
THAT.
IT DOESN'T MEAN THAT SOMETHING

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:51.711
DIDN'T HAPPEN --
&gt;&gt; BUT THE CAMERAS --

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:55.214
&gt;&gt; -- THERE'S NO PROOF.
&gt;&gt; SO BEFORE THE INCIDENT YOU'RE

00:06:55.214 --> 00:06:58.784
LOOKING AT OTHER SURVEILLANCE
CAMERAS AROUND THE CITY.

00:06:58.784 --> 00:07:04.190
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.
THOROUGHFARES, AND EVEN BUSINESS

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.325
CAMERAS.
ANY FOOTAGE WE COULD PICK UP TO

00:07:06.325 --> 00:07:08.561
SEE WHAT OCCURRED PRIOR TO THE
STOP?

00:07:08.561 --> 00:07:13.399
THE INFORMATION THAT WE HAVE
RIGHT NOW OF -- BASED ON WHAT WE

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:21.807
COULD OBSERVE IS THE STOP ITSELF
AND THE FIRST OFFICER EXITING

00:07:21.807 --> 00:07:24.544
HIS VEHICLE, YOU'LL SEE THAT ON
THE BODY WORN CAMERA.

00:07:24.544 --> 00:07:27.747
AT THAT TIME, THE OFFICERS WERE
ALREADY AGGRESSIVE AND AMPED UP.

00:07:27.747 --> 00:07:29.248
&gt;&gt; AND AMPED UP.
&gt;&gt; UM-HUM.

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:36.055
&gt;&gt; SO YOU HAVEN'T FOUND ANYTHING
TO SUBSTANTIATE THE RECKLESS

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:37.290
DRIVING.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.358
&gt;&gt; AND THIS WAS JUST FEET FROM
HIS HOME.

00:07:39.358 --> 00:07:42.795
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.
THREE BLOCKS AWAY.

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:49.302
&gt;&gt; HE WAS APPREHENDED BY THE
SCORPION LEADERSHIP, LAUNCHED

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:51.437
UNDER YOUR LEADERSHIP IN 2021.
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:55.274
&gt;&gt; WERE THEY LOOKING FOR SOME
OTHER CRIME OTHER THAN RECKLESS

00:07:55.274 --> 00:08:00.613
DRIVING FROM TYRE NICHOLS?
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:08:00.613 --> 00:08:08.487
WELL, THE SCORPION UNITS, STREET
CRIME OPERATIONS TO REPORT PIECE

00:08:08.487 --> 00:08:11.691
IN OUR NEIGHBORHOODS.
IT WAS BASED ON THE FACT THAT WE

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:15.561
HAD AN OUTCRY BECAUSE OF THREE
YEARS OF VIOLENCE IN THE CITY.

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:20.766
NUMBERS OF VIOLENT CRIMES,
ROBBERIES, HOMICIDES, AGGRAVATED

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:26.639
ASSAULTS, AND THIS IS ONE OF
THREE TEAMS, WHOSE PRIMARY

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:34.046
RESPONSIBILITY IS TO REDUCE GUN
VIOLENCE, TO BE VISIBLE IN

00:08:34.046 --> 00:08:37.917
COMMUNITIES, AND TO ALSO IMPACT
THE RISE IN THE CRIME.

00:08:37.917 --> 00:08:41.087
BASICALLY OUT OF AN OUTCRY FROM
THE COMMUNITY.

00:08:41.087 --> 00:08:45.624
WE HAD RECORD NUMBERS IN 2021,
346 HOMICIDES.

00:08:45.624 --> 00:08:48.494
SO THIS UNIT WAS PUT TOGETHER
AND THEY HAD GREAT SUCCESS,

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:54.166
BELIEVE IT OR NOT, LAST YEAR.
IT WAS THE FIRST YEAR IN A LONG

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:57.036
TIME --
&gt;&gt; IS THIS AN INDICATION OF A

00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.740
FAILURE IN THAT UNIT?
&gt;&gt; THIS IS AN INDICATION THAT

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:03.109
THERE IS A GAP SOMEWHERE IN THAT
UNIT.

00:09:03.109 --> 00:09:06.579
MY OBSERVATION IS THAT, YOU
KNOW, WE HAVE SEVERAL

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:11.584
CONTRIBUTING FACTORS.
WE TRAIN AND WE RE-TRAIN THESE

00:09:11.584 --> 00:09:16.322
OFFICERS JUST LIKE SPECIALIZED
UNITS AROUND THE COUNTRY.

00:09:16.322 --> 00:09:20.026
THESE OFFICERS IN WORKING IN
SPECIALIZED UNITS, YOU ALWAYS

00:09:20.026 --> 00:09:25.998
NEED TO MAKE SURE THAT THE SUPER
VISION IS THERE AND PRESENT.

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:30.169
&gt;&gt; DO YOU FEAR THEY HAVE DONE
ANYTHING LIKE THIS IN THE PAST?

00:09:30.169 --> 00:09:31.404
DO YOU HAVE ANY EVIDENCE OF
THAT?

00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:34.339
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T HAVE EVIDENCE OF IT
AT THIS POINT IN TIME.

00:09:34.339 --> 00:09:39.945
HOWEVER WE'RE TAKING A DEEPER
DIVE INTO PREVIOUS ARRESTS,

00:09:39.945 --> 00:09:44.884
PREVIOUS VIDEO CAMERA FOOTAGE.
WE ALSO REACHED OUT TO THE IACP,

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:46.485
WHO WILL WORK WITH THE
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE.

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:49.822
WE'VE ASKED THE IACP AND THE
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE TO COME IN

00:09:49.822 --> 00:09:52.425
AND LOOK AT OUR SPECIALIZED
UNITS.

00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:56.262
WE DON'T WANT ANY GAPS IN ANY OF
OUR UNITS.

00:09:56.262 --> 00:10:02.234
&gt;&gt; I'VE HEARD ABOUT YOU FROM
EVERY SINGLE PERSON THAT I SPOKE

00:10:02.234 --> 00:10:04.704
TO THAT THE BUCK STOPS WITH YOU.
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:10:04.704 --> 00:10:06.972
&gt;&gt; DO YOU FEEL YOU HAVE ANY
RESPONSIBILITY IN THE FAILURE OF

00:10:06.972 --> 00:10:10.609
THE UNIT?
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T REMOVE MYSELF FROM

00:10:10.609 --> 00:10:12.544
RESPONSIBILITY.
AND, OF COURSE, WE CAN'T ALWAYS

00:10:12.544 --> 00:10:16.816
BE WITH OUR OFFICERS BUT IT'S
INCUMBENT UPON US TO ACT AND

00:10:16.816 --> 00:10:18.517
HAVE CHECKS AND BALANCES IN
PLACE.

00:10:18.517 --> 00:10:21.087
BUT WE HAVE TO RELY ON THOSE
INDIVIDUALS THAT ARE ALSO IN

00:10:21.087 --> 00:10:23.622
SUPERVISORY POSITIONS AND
COMMANDERS' POSITIONS BUT THE

00:10:23.622 --> 00:10:28.294
ACCOUNTABILITY IS THROUGHOUT THE
POLICE DEPARTMENT UP TO THE

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.395
CHIEF. 

